      "snippet": {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "theorem base_rate_of_raw_log {W : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup W] [NormedSpace ℝ W]\n    {U : Set SpaceTime} {q : SpaceTime → ℝ} {f : SpaceTime → W}\n    (hq : ∀ w ∈ U, 0 < q w) (C P K : ℕ → ℝ)\n    (hb : ∀ m w, w ∈ U → ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f w‖ ≤\n      C m * (1 + |Real.log (q w)|) ^ P m * q w ^ (-K m)) :\n    ∀ m, JetRate (scaleApproach U q) q f m (-(K m + 1))"
      }
    }
  }
